PROVENANCE — Lottie assets in this directory
=============================================

Every Lottie JSON committed here is ORIGINAL WORK authored by this project
(or an explicitly CC0 file), so it is license-clean to bundle and redistribute.
We do NOT commit third-party Lottie JSON — a user's own file is read from THEIR
path at render time and is never copied into the repo.

